 between Natassia and Amy comes to a boiling point. Annelies confesses that she carries a secret.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-17\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Game, Set, Match\",\"overview\":\"Melissa, Natassia and Amy try to talk out their feuds during an intense conversation. Peace seems to have returned until Natassia invites the ladies for a weekend in 'Durbuy' during a game of tennis.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Smelly Catfights in Durbuy\",\"overview\":\"Annelies and Amy think the glamping tents smell of sweaty feet and decide to go to a hotel. When during a star dinner not only 'fine food' but also all the underlying frustrations end up on the table, it becomes too much for Oona and Amy.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Durbuy Part Two\",\"overview\":\"There is a cold war between Annelies and Amy on one side and Natassia, Melissa, Oona and Kiki on the other. Nevertheless, Kiki decides to go to the long-awaited birthday of Amy's dog Ralphie to restore peace in the group.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Knocked Off\",\"overview\":\"Kiki and Natassia decide to continue working on the good atmosphere by inviting all the ladies to Knokke. However, Annelies' plus one throws a spanner in the works. Annelies pours out her heart about her past to Amy.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"De Reünie\",\"overview\":\"A few months after the eventful party in Knokke, host Jani Kazaltzis welcomes the seven women for the long-awaited reunion.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtime\":57}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-03-17\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":864